/P 587 0 R
/T (The core problem is the unverified and often blind trust placed in the code generated by AI-assisted coding tools. The rapid adoption of platforms like GitHub Copilot has enabled developers, especially novices and hobbyists, to build and deploy applications without a deep understanding of the underlying logic. This creates a critical gap where code is moved into production without undergoing the necessary scrutiny for quality, security, and performance.)
/E (The core problem is the unverified and often blind trust placed in the code generated by AI-assisted coding tools. The rapid adoption of platforms like GitHub Copilot has enabled developers, especially novices and hobbyists, to build and deploy applications without a deep understanding of the underlying logic. This creates a critical gap where code is moved into production without undergoing the necessary scrutiny for quality, security, and performance.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
