/S /H2
/P 588 0 R
/T (Consequently, modern codebases are increasingly susceptible to containing hidden flaws introduced by AI, such as critical security vulnerabilities, subtle performance bottlenecks, and poor architectural practices \("code smells"\). Existing analysis tools are ill-equipped to handle this new paradigm, as traditional static analyzers lack the contextual understanding to identify complex logical flaws, while pure LLM-based tools are often too slow and unreliable for systematic, large-scale verification.)
/E (Consequently, modern codebases are increasingly susceptible to containing hidden flaws introduced by AI, such as critical security vulnerabilities, subtle performance bottlenecks, and poor architectural practices \("code smells"\). Existing analysis tools are ill-equipped to handle this new paradigm, as traditional static analyzers lack the contextual understanding to identify complex logical flaws, while pure LLM-based tools are often too slow and unreliable for systematic, large-scale verification.)
